WEBVTT

00:00.240 --> 00:01.200
Your Highness

00:01.280 --> 00:02.947
Be careful in all matters

00:06.120 --> 00:07.520
Don't worry

00:17.960 --> 00:19.040
Stop swaying

00:19.120 --> 00:20.520
It's distracting

00:21.960 --> 00:23.040
Or perhaps, Your Excellency

00:23.120 --> 00:24.240
Could pay someone to perform a ritual

00:24.400 --> 00:26.480
To make Yu Gong appear from the Imperial City Guard

00:26.560 --> 00:27.960
Enough, both of you

00:30.280 --> 00:31.680
Your Highness

00:40.840 --> 00:41.600
Your Highness

00:41.680 --> 00:42.320
Tell us

00:42.400 --> 00:43.800
About that day

00:46.400 --> 00:48.000
Yu Gong, Chancellor of the Imperial Academy

00:48.080 --> 00:49.320
Was like a teacher to me

00:49.400 --> 00:49.760
That day

00:49.840 --> 00:50.760
That day

00:50.840 --> 00:52.480
He introduced his disciples to me

00:52.560 --> 00:53.760
After several rounds of wine

00:53.840 --> 00:54.480
Your Highness

00:54.560 --> 00:55.960
He got carried away

00:56.080 --> 00:56.720
Composed a sentimental poem

00:56.800 --> 00:57.280
Never forget

00:57.440 --> 00:59.773
The resolve to recover our divine land

00:59.960 --> 01:01.360
Now

01:01.480 --> 01:02.440
His poem

01:02.520 --> 01:04.400
Has been framed by my elder brother and the Chen family

01:04.480 --> 01:05.880
As inciting rebellion

01:06.400 --> 01:07.600
This is a disaster

01:07.680 --> 01:09.680
What exactly did Yu Gong say?

01:10.120 --> 01:11.880
What he wrote doesn't matter

01:12.400 --> 01:12.960
Since

01:13.120 --> 01:14.840
Your Highness was present that day

01:14.920 --> 01:16.240
Prince of Ning and the Chen family

01:16.320 --> 01:19.440
Must be trying to drag Your Highness into this

01:20.040 --> 01:21.160
The urgent matter

01:21.240 --> 01:22.400
Is to eliminate all those

01:22.480 --> 01:24.920
Who were present at the tavern that day

01:25.040 --> 01:26.600
To cut ties with Yu Gong

01:26.680 --> 01:28.240
And ensure this matter

01:28.600 --> 01:30.600
Does not touch you at all

01:31.040 --> 01:32.800
Minister Xie speaks so casually

01:33.440 --> 01:34.840
How many must die?

01:36.600 --> 01:37.520
Your Highness

01:37.600 --> 01:38.840
Yu Gong has great prestige

01:38.920 --> 01:39.560
In the Imperial Academy

01:39.720 --> 01:40.960
And among the people

01:41.040 --> 01:43.400
He has also recommended many talents to Your Highness

01:43.480 --> 01:45.080
If Your Highness abandons him

01:45.160 --> 01:47.040
What will scholars think?

01:47.360 --> 01:48.600
Moreover

01:48.680 --> 01:50.000
If you don't protect your own

01:50.160 --> 01:51.400
In the future

01:51.480 --> 01:52.880
Which court official

01:53.800 --> 01:55.467
Would dare serve Your Highness

01:55.720 --> 01:56.720
With wholehearted loyalty?

01:56.800 --> 01:58.280
A benevolent ruler cannot stand in troubled times

01:58.360 --> 02:00.840
Your Highness aims to recover the northern lost lands

02:00.920 --> 02:03.280
If you hesitate for one subordinate

02:03.560 --> 02:05.200
And create a rift with His Majesty

02:05.280 --> 02:06.080
Then

02:06.160 --> 02:08.160
That would be a greater loss

02:08.360 --> 02:09.080
Of course

02:09.160 --> 02:10.160
How to decide

02:10.240 --> 02:12.560
Is up to Your Highness
